# MemoryAgentBench: all four equal the Hugging Face dataset ai-hyz/MemoryAgentBench at revision
# 7ea066982b140a19337e17e60d45d4076e042faf (data/<file>); the experiment tree holds two Test_Time_Learning copies, equal.
# BEAM: built from the benchmark's own data by harness/beam/build_parquet.py, build_parquet_1m.py, build_parquet_10m.py.
# LoCoMo: the store texts are rebuilt from snap-research/locomo data/locomo10.json by muster.adapters.locomo (10 of 10 equal).
